    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mango lassi serves 4 and takes about 10 minutes. Use ripe, sweet mango for the best flavour, or good tinned mango pulp. Chill the glasses while you blend."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blend until truly smooth and adjust the sugar to the sweetness of your mango."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
